{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21973","headline":"丘中有一士二首 一 · 白居易","name":"丘中有一士二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丘中有一士，不知其姓名。\n面色不忧苦，血气常和平。\n每选隙地居，不蹋要路行。\n举动无尤悔，物莫与之争。\n藜藿不充肠，布褐不蔽形。\n终岁守穷饿，而无嗟叹声。\n岂是爱贫贱，深知时俗情。\n勿矜罗弋巧，鸾鹤在冥冥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21973.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21973","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}